  "result": "The repository's rules don't say this. None of the files mention a Manager role or an approval limit, and nothing specifies what happens to an invoice when an approval is refused. `AGENTS.md` only covers the general conventions: approvals are restricted to Approver or Admin via `[RequireRole]`, and controllers map service errors to 404, 409 and 400 through `Handle(...)`. The use-case briefs in `docs/use-cases` don't cover approval limits either.\n\nThe closest code is `backend/src/InvoiceApp.Domain/ApprovalService.cs`, which owns the lifecycle, but I didn't read its approve path, so I can't say whether a refused approval changes the invoice's status. The project's rules would need a new entry to answer this.",
